// Host-side per-present drain for the EA audio bridge. The guest submits SCDl
// packets in bursts and then waits for SPU2-side consumption, so pumping only
// from the guest sound hooks starves the host stream once the ring is full
// (submittedFrames freezes at 3200 while queuedFrames keeps growing). The
// present loop runs at display rate on the raylib main thread, which is also
// the safest place to touch raylib audio streams.
void mohPumpHostAudioBridge()
{
    mohMovieAudioBridge().pump();
    mohMenuMusicStreamer().feed();
    mohMenuMusicBridge().pump();
}
